<view class="about-page">
  <view class="brand-card">
    <image class="brand-logo" src="/assets/brand/udajo-logo-transparent.png" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="洋豆角 UDAJO" />
    <view class="brand-title">让留学变得更简单</view>
    <view class="brand-subtitle">留学生境外一站式服务平台</view>
  </view>

  <view class="about-card">
    <view class="section-title">我们提供</view>
    <view class="service-row"><text class="service-dot">01</text><view class="service-copy"><view>院校查询</view><text>根据个人需求在线查找筛选专业信息，锁定目标院校</text></view></view>
    <view class="service-row"><text class="service-dot">02</text><view class="service-copy"><view>留学规划</view><text>AI规划与专业规划师双重保障</text></view></view>
    <view class="service-row"><text class="service-dot">03</text><view class="service-copy"><view>签证办理</view><text>全程签证代办，专业团队保障</text></view></view>
    <view class="service-row"><text class="service-dot">04</text><view class="service-copy"><view>落地注册</view><text>留学生落地海外之后的注册接机及注册报道办理</text></view></view>
    <view class="service-row"><text class="service-dot">05</text><view class="service-copy"><view>U圈交流</view><text>留学生分享留学经验和问题，在线租房、交流学业、交友平台</text></view></view>
    <view class="service-row"><text class="service-dot">06</text><view class="service-copy"><view>实习就业</view><text>实习就业一站式信息共享平台，让求职更近一步</text></view></view>
    <view class="service-row"><text class="service-dot">07</text><view class="service-copy"><view>继续深造</view><text>洋豆角提供学历继续深造服务，帮优秀的人获得更好的机会</text></view></view>
  </view>

  <view class="about-card contact-card">
    <view class="section-title">联系我们</view>
    <button class="contact-row" bindtap="callPhone" aria-label="拨打电话 {{phone}}"><view><text class="contact-label">电话</text><text class="contact-value">{{phone}}</text></view><text class="contact-action">拨号</text></button>
    <button class="contact-row" data-value="{{email}}" bindtap="copyContact" aria-label="复制邮箱 {{email}}"><view><text class="contact-label">邮箱</text><text class="contact-value">{{email}}</text></view><text class="contact-action">复制</text></button>
    <view wx:for="{{wechatAccounts}}" wx:key="*this" class="contact-row contact-row--static"><view><text class="contact-label">微信号{{index + 1}}</text><text class="contact-value">{{item}}</text></view><button class="copy-button" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="copyContact" aria-label="复制微信号 {{item}}">复制</button></view>
  </view>
</view>
